{"name":"The Attribute Key","slug":"glyph-attribute-key","blurb":"On the designate street, Cass carries the key toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Attribute. Click the key and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Attribute Key.","seal":"5df86f92c8d35fb29b2755ffb8a30063808dc8e9a418b8dab8165fbf1a2cd602"}
